{"id":"reference/opaque","kind":"langref","title":"opaque","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#opaque","file":"reference/opaque.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"opaque","text":"opaque"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"opaque\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">opaque</a></h2>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">opaque</span> {}</code> 声明一个大小和对齐均未知但非零的新类型。它可以像<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#struct\">结构体</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">联合</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">枚举</a>一样包含声明。</p>\n      <p>这通常用于与不公开结构体细节的 C 代码交互时保证类型安全。例如：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_opaque.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Derp</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">opaque</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Wat</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">opaque</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">bar</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Derp</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Wat</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">callconv</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">bar</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"call foo\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">undefined</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_opaque.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:6:9: error: expected type '*test_opaque.Derp', found '*test_opaque.Wat'</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">bar(w);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">        </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:6:9: note: pointer type child 'test_opaque.Wat' cannot cast into pointer type child 'test_opaque.Derp'</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:2:13: note: opaque declared here</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">const Wat = opaque {};</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">            </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^~~~~~~~~</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:1:14: note: opaque declared here</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">const Derp = opaque {};</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">             </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^~~~~~~~~</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:4:18: note: parameter type declared here</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">extern fn bar(d: *Derp) void;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">                 </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">^~~~~</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">referenced by:</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">test.call foo: /home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:10:8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":4,"translated":4}}
